
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="pt-BR">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="theme-color" content="#111111">
  <title>Meu carrinho — SóAchei</title>
  <link rel="stylesheet" href="style.css">
  <style>
    .cart-page {max-width:1000px;margin:35px auto;padding:20px}
    .cart-page h1 {margin-bottom:10px}
    .cart-panel {background:white;padding:24px;border-radius:14px;margin-top:22px}
    .cart-row {display:flex;align-items:center;gap:15px;padding:18px 0;border-bottom:1px solid #eee}
    .cart-emoji {font-size:35px}
    .cart-product {flex:1}
    .cart-product p {color:#777;margin-top:5px}
    .quantity {display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px}
    .quantity button,.remove-item {padding:8px 12px;border-radius:6px;background:#eee}
    .remove-item {color:#b00020}
    .cart-summary {margin-top:25px;padding-top:20px;border-top:2px solid #eee}
    .cart-summary h2 {margin:12px 0}
    .cart-actions {display:flex;gap:12px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:20px}
    .cart-actions a,.cart-actions button {padding:14px 18px;border-radius:8px;font-weight:bold;text-align:center}
    .back-products {background:#eee}
    .finish-order {background:#ffd400;color:#111}
    .empty-cart {padding:35px 0;text-align:center}
    @media(max-width:600px) {
      .cart-row {flex-wrap:wrap}
      .cart-product {min-width:60%}
      .quantity {margin-left:45px}
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <header class="top">
    <div class="header-main">
      <a class="logo" href="index.html">
        <span class="bag">🛍️</span>
        <span>Só<span>Achei</span><small>Achou. Gostou. Comprou.</small></span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </header>

  <main class="cart-page">
    <a href="index.html">← Continuar comprando</a>
    <h1 style="margin-top:25px">🛒 Meu carrinho</h1>
    <p>Confira seus produtos antes de finalizar o pedido.</p>

    <section class="cart-panel">
      <div id="cartItems"></div>

      <div class="cart-summary">
        <p>Subtotal: <strong id="cartSubtotal">R$ 0,00</strong></p>
        <h2>Total: <span id="cartTotal">R$ 0,00</span></h2>
        <p style="color:#777;font-size:13px">Frete e prazo serão confirmados no atendimento.</p>

        <div class="cart-actions">
          <a class="back-products" href="index.html">Continuar comprando</a>
          <button class="finish-order" onclick="checkout()">Finalizar pelo WhatsApp</button>
        </div>
      </div>
    </section>
  </main>

  <script src="script.js"></script>
</body>
</html>
